Where M1 is the total mass of the organic waste provided to the BSF larva, M2 is the total mass of the organic waste treated by the BSF larva. Feed conversion efficiency indicate the digestive ability of BSF larvae feeding on distinct materials. This index can be calculated as (Bosch et al. 2019):
Feed conversion efficiency = Total mass of ingested food (gram)
